dataSourcesTreatmentAndRepresentativenes.dataSelectionAndCombinationPrinciples:
Good consistency of data and modelling. The primary activity data are used with Ecoinvent database 3.6, cut-off. Data gaps in the foreground model are filled with data from Ecoinvent database. 
The exchanges are judged by experts to be representative for the glass supply chain at national level.
The LCA study is based on the following assumptions:
 - electricity entirely from national grid;
 - water entirely from tap water;
 - packaging includes wooden pallets and paper;
 - wastes include a share of packaging materials;
 - output transports consider a distance of 20 km for waste intended for landfill and a distance of 160 km for waste intended for recycling plant.
